<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix of Proposal-Level Graph Construction</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The construction of the RPG is central to our framework, as it transforms high-level repository goals into a structured and persistent representation. The process starts with carefully designed prompting strategies for selecting repository-relevant functionalities from the global feature ontology, followed by iterative refinement to ensure both semantic coverage and modular coherence.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Algorithms of Functionality Graph Construction</h3>

<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Rejection Sampling Algorithm</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We extend the base sampling strategy introduced in <span id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">EpiCoder</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite> by incorporating a diversity-aware rejection mechanism, as shown in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Rejection Sampling Algorithm ‣ A.1 Algorithms of Functionality Graph Construction ‣ Appendix A Appendix of Proposal-Level Graph Construction ‣ RPG: A Repository Planning Graph for Unified and Scalable Codebase Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. At each step, a candidate tree is accepted only if its overlap with previously sampled nodes is below a specified threshold; otherwise, the tree with the minimal overlap is returned. This encourages broader feature space exploration under a limited number of sampling iterations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Feature Sampling with Diversity-Aware Rejection Sampling</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
                
                
              Root node <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math>; frequency library <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>F</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F</annotation></semantics></math>; temperature <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>;
per-tree sample size <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>; overlap threshold <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ρ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho</annotation></semantics></math>;
maximum number of retries <math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
                
                
              <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span> <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BaseSample</span>(<math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R,F,t,S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R,F,t,S</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
                
                
                selected_set <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
                
                
                <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\leftarrow\textsc{get\_children}(R)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">get_children</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\leftarrow\textsc{get\_children}(R)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
                
                
                 <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> 
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
                
                
                   <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span> 
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
                
                
                 <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{i}\leftarrow F[i]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{i}\leftarrow F[i]</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in C</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{i}\leftarrow f_{i}/\sum_{j\in C}f_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">/</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{i}\leftarrow f_{i}/\sum_{j\in C}f_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in C</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{i}\leftarrow\textsc{TempTransform}(p_{i},t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">TempTransform</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{i}\leftarrow\textsc{TempTransform}(p_{i},t)</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in C</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
                
                
                 cur_node <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\textsc{sample\_node}(C,[q_{1},q_{2},\dots])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">sample_node</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\textsc{sample\_node}(C,[q_{1},q_{2},\dots])</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
