<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Repository-Aligned Subtree Selection</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Repository-Aligned Subtree Selection ‣ A.1 Algorithms of Functionality Graph Construction ‣ Appendix A Appendix of Proposal-Level Graph Construction ‣ RPG: A Repository Planning Graph for Unified and Scalable Codebase Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> outlines the procedure for constructing a repository-specific feature subtree from a global feature tree. The algorithm iteratively selects candidate features based on a combination of exploitation (retrieving top-scoring nodes) and exploration (sampling unvisited nodes). At each iteration, an LLM agent filters and ranks candidates, proposes missing but relevant features, and performs batch-level self-checks to ensure internal consistency. Accepted candidates are incorporated into the current subtree, and the process continues until a fixed iteration budget is reached. The resulting subtree captures features most relevant to the target repository while balancing coverage and quality.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Repository-Specific Subtree Selection</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
                
                
              Global Feature Tree <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math>; Repo description <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math>; iteration budget <math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>; top-<math id="alg2.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>; termination threshold <math id="alg2.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>; batch size <math id="alg2.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>; <span id="alg2.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">LLM</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
                
                
              Repository-specific subtree <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
                
                
              Initialize current repo tree <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{\prime}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{\prime}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>; missing features <math id="alg2.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>missing</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>; visited set <math id="alg2.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=1\dots K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=1\dots K</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span> <span id="alg2.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> iterate with given budget
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\text{exploit}}\leftarrow\textsc{RetrieveTopK}(\mathcal{T},\mathcal{R},k=\text{top-}k)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>exploit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">RetrieveTopK</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>top-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\text{exploit}}\leftarrow\textsc{RetrieveTopK}(\mathcal{T},\mathcal{R},k=\text{top-}k)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l5.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> select promising nodes (exploit)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\text{explore}}\leftarrow\textsc{SampleUnvisited}(\mathcal{T},\mathcal{V})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>explore</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SampleUnvisited</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\text{explore}}\leftarrow\textsc{SampleUnvisited}(\mathcal{T},\mathcal{V})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> sample unexplored nodes (explore)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
                
                
                <span id="alg2.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Candidate selection via LLM</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{exploit}}\leftarrow\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{SelectExploitCandidates}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{exploit}},\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{R})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>exploit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SelectExploitCandidates</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>exploit</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{exploit}}\leftarrow\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{SelectExploitCandidates}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{exploit}},\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{R})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> filter exploit candidates
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{explore}}\leftarrow\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{SelectExploreCandidates}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{explore}},\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{R})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>explore</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SelectExploreCandidates</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>explore</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{explore}}\leftarrow\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{SelectExploreCandidates}(\mathcal{E}_{\text{explore}},\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{R})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> filter explore candidates
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}\cup\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{ProposeMissing}(\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{R})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>missing</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>missing</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">ProposeMissing</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}\cup\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{ProposeMissing}(\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{R})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> generate novel candidates not in tree
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
                
                
                <math id="alg2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{raw}}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{exploit}}\cup\mathcal{C}_{\text{explore}}\cup\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>raw</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>exploit</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>explore</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>missing</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{raw}}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{exploit}}\cup\mathcal{C}_{\text{explore}}\cup\mathcal{C}_{\text{missing}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l11.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> merge all candidate sources
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
                
                
                <span id="alg2.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Batch self-check (filter useful paths within each batch)</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
                
                
                <span id="alg2.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for all</span> <math id="alg2.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{batch }\mathcal{B}\subseteq\mathcal{C}_{\text{raw}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>batch </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi></mrow><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>raw</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{batch }\mathcal{B}\subseteq\mathcal{C}_{\text{raw}}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="alg2.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{B}|\leq B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{B}|\leq B</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span> <span id="alg2.l13.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> process in small batches
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg2.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{B}^{\star}\leftarrow\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{SELFCHECK}(\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{B})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SELFCHECK</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{B}^{\star}\leftarrow\texttt{LLM}.\textsc{SELFCHECK}(\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{B})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l14.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> accept only consistent/relevant paths
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg2.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{\prime}\leftarrow\textsc{InsertPaths}(\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{B}^{\star})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">InsertPaths</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{\prime}\leftarrow\textsc{InsertPaths}(\mathcal{T}^{\prime},\mathcal{B}^{\star})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l15.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> expand repo-specific tree
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
                
                
                 <math id="alg2.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}\leftarrow\mathcal{V}\cup\mathcal{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}\leftarrow\mathcal{V}\cup\mathcal{B}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l16.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> mark all evaluated paths as visited
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
                
                
                <span id="alg2.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l19.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> return final subtree
</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Repo Subtree Reorganization into the functionality graph</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The algorithm operates in three stages to refactor subtree. In the first stage, an LLM agent iteratively extracts meaningful subtrees from the input hierarchy, organizing them into initial subgraphs until a sufficient coverage of leaf nodes is reached. In the second stage, the agent reorganizes the subgraphs by merging semantically related components or moving branches across groups to improve structure. Finally, each subgraph is refined to ensure naming consistency and hierarchical coherence, yielding a clean, interpretable functionality graph.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
