<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Graph-Guided Localization and Editing Logs</h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To illustrate how the proposed system operates in practice, we include representative logs that demonstrate the end-to-end process: (i) locating relevant interfaces in the repository through RPG–guided exploration, and (ii) applying code editing operations to implement the required functionality. These logs capture the step-by-step decision process, tool invocations, and final termination results.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS3.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="57.8" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 650 57.8" width="650"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,57.8) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 53.17 C 0 55.72 2.07 57.8 4.63 57.8 L 645.37 57.8 C 647.93 57.8 650 55.72 650 53.17 L 650 4.63 C 650 2.07 647.93 0 645.37 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 36.24 L 649.31 36.24 L 649.31 4.63 C 649.31 2.45 647.55 0.69 645.37 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.47 43.56)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.53em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="533.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
