<td id="A3.T8.8.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6.81<math id="A3.T8.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.87</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7.10<math id="A3.T8.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.98</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7.48<math id="A3.T8.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.85</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6.98<math id="A3.T8.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.92</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.6.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6.49<math id="A3.T8.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.79</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.6.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7.12<math id="A3.T8.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.77</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T8.8.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Debugging</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">6.75<math id="A3.T8.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>2.21</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">6.01<math id="A3.T8.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>2.16</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">6.25<math id="A3.T8.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.82</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">6.62<math id="A3.T8.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>2.47</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">5.94<math id="A3.T8.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>2.19</td>
<td id="A3.T8.8.1.7.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">6.42<math id="A3.T8.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>1.94</td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="A3.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ C.5 Statistics of Three Stage ‣ Appendix C Appendix of Graph-Guided Repository Generation ‣ RPG: A Repository Planning Graph for Unified and Scalable Codebase Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, <span id="A3.SS5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">o3-mini</span> achieves relatively high code success rates across repositories, often exceeding 75% and in some cases approaching 90%, whereas <span id="A3.SS5.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">qwen3-coder</span> lags behind with rates around 50–55%. In contrast, the corresponding test coverage remains moderate, typically within the 60–70% range. Figure <a href="#A3.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ C.5 Statistics of Three Stage ‣ Appendix C Appendix of Graph-Guided Repository Generation ‣ RPG: A Repository Planning Graph for Unified and Scalable Codebase Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> further illustrates that coverage fluctuates and tends to decline as code length increases: shorter implementations reach high class-level coverage, but both function-level and overall coverage drop significantly with greater complexity. These results suggest that while current models are increasingly effective at generating functional code, their ability to produce comprehensive and high-quality test cases remains limited, highlighting test generation as a key bottleneck for practical deployment.</p>
</div>
