</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T10.4.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T10.4.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:41.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">scikit-learn</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T10.4.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:51.7pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MLKit-Py</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T10.4.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:41.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Machine Learning Framework</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T10.4.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.6pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Provides efficient tools for data mining and analysis, supporting classical supervised and unsupervised learning algorithms.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T10.4.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A4.T10.4.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:96.6pt;">
