</div>
<div id="lstnumberx873" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx873.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">          </span><span id="lstnumberx873.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx873.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">test_dummy_quantile_parameter_tuning</span><span id="lstnumberx873.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">",</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx874" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx874.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">          </span><span id="lstnumberx874.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx874.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">test_pinball_loss_relation_with_mae</span><span id="lstnumberx874.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx875" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx875.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">        </span><span id="lstnumberx875.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">]</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx876" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx876.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">      </span><span id="lstnumberx876.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx877" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx877.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">    </span><span id="lstnumberx877.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx878" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx878.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">  </span><span id="lstnumberx878.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx879" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx879.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">}</span>
</div>
</div>
<p id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">This taxonomy mirrors repository semantics: higher levels correspond to broad functional modules, while deeper levels capture fine-grained algorithmic tests.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Sampling and Filtering.</h5>

<div id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To ensure balanced coverage, we applied the sampling algorithm(Alg <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Rejection Sampling Algorithm ‣ A.1 Algorithms of Functionality Graph Construction ‣ Appendix A Appendix of Proposal-Level Graph Construction ‣ RPG: A Repository Planning Graph for Unified and Scalable Codebase Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>) to draw representative subsets of test categories. Each sampled test was then refined into a task description that models could follow during generation. Finally, we filtered out cases irrelevant to core algorithmic behavior (e.g., string formatting checks, version consistency tests), retaining only tests that probe substantive computational functionality.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Example Task Instance.</h5>

<div id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To illustrate the outcome of the pipeline, consider the following task specification extracted from the <span id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Django</span> repository:</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx880" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx880.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx881" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx881.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">    </span><span id="lstnumberx881.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx881.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">category</span><span id="lstnumberx881.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">":</span><span id="lstnumberx881.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx881.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx881.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">gis_migrations</span><span id="lstnumberx881.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">",</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx882" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx882.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">    </span><span id="lstnumberx882.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx882.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">file</span><span id="lstnumberx882.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">":</span><span id="lstnumberx882.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx882.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx882.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">tests</span><span id="lstnumberx882.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/</span><span id="lstnumberx882.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">gis_tests</span><span id="lstnumberx882.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/</span><span id="lstnumberx882.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">gis_migrations</span><span id="lstnumberx882.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/</span><span id="lstnumberx882.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">test_operations</span><span id="lstnumberx882.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx882.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">py</span><span id="lstnumberx882.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">",</span>
