<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Detailed Experiment Results</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the results of different methods on six repositories. For each repository, the methods are evaluated under the same settings to enable direct comparison.</p>
</div>
